      "content": "i get that i should ask the doctor but they are super hard to get ahold of and i cant wait days for an appointment when i can barely breathe lol. does sudafed actually do anything with the haloperidol or is it just a general warning? i've took sudafed before with other meds and was fine. is it really that risky or is it just a precaution?",
